  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "256765e6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "049be2ed",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 背景信息"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "60bb2f48",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "若研究目标是对响应曲面进行近似拟合:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e7c5b277",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- 当响应曲面起伏粗糙时,采用能够均匀填充参数空间的试验设计会更合适(左上);\n",
    "- 而当函数曲面光滑平缓时,在参数边界附近布置更多采样点的设计方案效果更佳(右上);\n",
    "- 若目标为求取函数最大值,则应在全局极大值附近加密布置试验采样点(左下);\n",
    "- 与之相对,若研究目标是开展不确定性传递分析,采样点的排布方式则需要贴合输入参数的概率分布特征(右下)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4cbfd2a3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "584ed0fa",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 指令"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "19361ca2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "创建宽 10 英寸,高 10 英寸的画布:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9be5fe50",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "options(repr.plot.width=10, repr.plot.height=10)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2003e3ad",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "将画布划分为 2x2 的网格:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ce549fd2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "par(mfrow=c(2,2))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e25ceeb9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "创建从 $0$ 到 $1$ 的 301 个点:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b73c8309",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "x=seq(0,1,length=301)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "09b090ad",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "1. 左上图:令函数"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cda6231d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "y:=\\frac{\\sin(10\\pi x)}{1+64(x-1/2)^{2}},\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ce0411d3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "y=sin(10*pi*x)/(1+64*(x-.5)^2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2485fd71",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "作图 $(x,y)$,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 折线类型为光滑曲线;\n",
    "- 不显示坐标轴;\n",
    "- 不显示 $x$,$y$ 轴;\n",
    "- 线宽为 3;\n",
    "- 颜色为黑色;\n",
    "- $y$ 轴范围为其最小值下延 $0.05$ 至其最大值;\n",
    "- 图形主标题为"approximate a rough function";\n",
    "- 主标题缩放倍数为 2:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e9dd5522",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "plot(x,y,type=\"l\",axes=FALSE,xlab=\"\",ylab=\"\",lwd=3,col=1,ylim=c(min(y)-.05,max(y)),main=\"approximate a rough function\",cex.main=2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "bd9770f0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "生成 15 个在 $[0,1]$ 区间上均匀分布的点:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "28c30893",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "n=15\n",
    "D=((1:n)-.5)/n\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "431a2aa8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "在已有图形上添加散点,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 点的横坐标为上述 15 个点,纵坐标取 $y$ 的最小值向下偏移 $0.05$;\n",
    "- 点的形状为实心圆;\n",
    "- 点的缩放倍数为 2;\n",
    "- 点的颜色为蓝色:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "01135a6c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "points(cbind(D,max(y)-0.05),pch=16,cex=2,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4300571e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "2. 右上图:令函数"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3ef2da66",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "y:=\\frac{1}{1+64(x-1/2)^{2}},\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f6a2a526",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "y=1/(1+64*(x-.5)^2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a3fa5c8c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "作图 $(x,y)$,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 折线类型为光滑曲线;\n",
    "- 不显示坐标轴;\n",
    "- 不显示 $x$,$y$ 轴;\n",
    "- 线宽为 3;\n",
    "- 颜色为黑色;\n",
    "- $y$ 轴范围为其最小值下延 $0.05$ 至其最大值;\n",
    "- 图形主标题为"approximate a smooth function";\n",
    "- 主标题缩放倍数为 2:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dfd6f276",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "plot(x,y,type=\"l\",axes=FALSE,xlab=\"\",ylab=\"\",lwd=3,col=1,ylim=c(min(y)-.05,max(y)),main=\"approximate a smooth function\",cex.main=2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "26d7c92f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "两端密集,中间稀疏的点分布由 Beta 分布实现:给定的概率值为 15 个在 $[0,1]$ 区间上均匀分布的点,返回满足 $P(X\\le x)=p$ 的分位数 $x$,其中 $X\\sim\\mathrm{Beta}(1/2,1/2)$:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3df09bb9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "D=qbeta(((1:n)-.5)/n,.5,.5)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f53b0d26",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "在已有图形上添加散点,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 点的横坐标为上述 15 个点,纵坐标取 $y$ 的最小值向下偏移 $0.05$;\n",
    "- 点的形状为实心圆;\n",
    "- 点的缩放倍数为 2;\n",
    "- 点的颜色为蓝色:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d9774d14",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "points(cbind(D,max(y)-0.05),pch=16,cex=2,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e8800a3c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "3. 左下图:令函数"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fb91652b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "y:=\\frac{2}{3}f_{B(2,10)}(x)+\\frac{1}{3}f_{B(10,2)}(x),\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a68549b4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "其中 $f_{B(\\alpha,\\beta)}$ 是 Beta 分布的概率密度函数:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b57ec757",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "y=2/3*dbeta(x,2,10)+1/3*dbeta(x,10,2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4ac83f81",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "作图 $(x,y)$,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 折线类型为光滑曲线;\n",
    "- 不显示坐标轴;\n",
    "- 不显示 $x$,$y$ 轴;\n",
    "- 线宽为 3;\n",
    "- 颜色为黑色;\n",
    "- $y$ 轴范围为其最小值下延 $0.05$ 至其最大值;\n",
    "- 图形主标题为"optimization";\n",
    "- 主标题缩放倍数为 2:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d37cf138",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "plot(x,y,type=\"l\",axes=FALSE,xlab=\"\",ylab=\"\",lwd=3,col=1,ylim=c(min(y)-.05,max(y)),main=\"optimization\",cex.main=2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "587eb08f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "生成 5 个在 $[0,1]$ 区间上均匀分布的点:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "28b0d90b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "n1=n*2/3\n",
    "n2=n/3\n",
    "D0=((1:n2)-.5)/n2\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "aaa7f01b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "集中在左侧的点分布由 Beta 分布实现:给定的概率值为 10 个在 $[0,1]$ 区间上均匀分布的点,返回满足 $P(X\\le x)=p$ 的分位数 $x$,其中 $X\\sim\\mathrm{Beta}(2,10)$,再与 5 个在 $[0,1]$ 区间上均匀分布的点叠加成最终选取的 15 个点:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "bd547411",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "D=c(D0,qbeta(((1:n1)-.5)/n1,2,10))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1766a3ea",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "在已有图形上添加散点,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 点的横坐标为上述 15 个点,纵坐标取 $y$ 的最小值向下偏移 $0.05$;\n",
    "- 点的形状为实心圆;\n",
    "- 点的缩放倍数为 2;\n",
    "- 点的颜色为蓝色:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ed9cd9cc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "points(cbind(D,max(y)-0.05),pch=16,cex=2,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3b3aded7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "4. 右下图:令函数"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "794727cf",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "y:=\\frac{2}{3}f_{B(2,10)}(x)+\\frac{1}{3}f_{B(10,2)}(x),\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "26ad1dec",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "其中 $f_{B(\\alpha,\\beta)}$ 是 Beta 分布的概率密度函数:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "aa5fb173",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "y=2/3*dbeta(x,2,10)+1/3*dbeta(x,10,2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2787d329",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "作图 $(x,y)$,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 折线类型为光滑曲线;\n",
    "- 不显示坐标轴;\n",
    "- 不显示 $x$,$y$ 轴;\n",
    "- 线宽为 3;\n",
    "- 颜色为黑色;\n",
    "- $y$ 轴范围为其最小值下延 $0.05$ 至其最大值;\n",
    "- 图形主标题为"uncertainty propagation";\n",
    "- 主标题缩放倍数为 2:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3456bc32",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "plot(x,y,type=\"l\",axes=FALSE,xlab=\"\",ylab=\"\",lwd=3,col=1,ylim=c(min(y)-.05,max(y)),main=\"uncertainty propagation\",cex.main=2)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c8ec31ec",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "依据左右峰的权重比为 1:2,在 $B(2,10)$ 中随机生成 10000 个样本,在 $B(10,2)$ 中随机生成 5000 个样本,叠加成 15000 个样本:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "73c899ab",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "x=c(rbeta(1000*n1,2,10),rbeta(1000*n2,10,2))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "05f07711",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "使用 `support` 包中的函数 `sp` 来从 15000 个样本中选取最能代表原始分布的 15 个支持点,在返回的列表中选取列名为 `sp` 的成员作为最终选取的 15 个点:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0ecb7879",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "library(support)\n",
    "a=sp(n,1,dist.samp = cbind(x))\n",
    "D=a$sp\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ed0c3ffc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "在已有图形上添加散点,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 点的横坐标为上述 15 个点,纵坐标取 $y$ 的最小值向下偏移 $0.05$;\n",
    "- 点的形状为实心圆;\n",
    "- 点的缩放倍数为 2;\n",
    "- 点的颜色为蓝色:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7f569ae5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "points(cbind(D,max(y)-0.05),pch=16,cex=2,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ba6151b0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "将画布分割还原成默认的 1x1:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "62061aaf",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "par(mfrow=c(1,1))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "602b88a8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d296ae35",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 最终效果"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "36fa3d1d",
